From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shawn Zhang <shawn.zhang@pepperstone.com>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 15:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add hardened side-by-side cert policy settings UI

Runtime global toggles (denylist / pins / cert monitor / block) via
cert_policy_flags.json. Browser settings write the file; net hooks read
it. Intended for app.vanadium.hardened.* packages alongside official
Vanadium.

